WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.057
A flag or a suspension can now be undone. Staff reinstate a member from the same

00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:07.799
dialog.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.456
For a flagged member, Reinstate comes first, the milder choice. It asks for no note.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.682
One press, and the member is Active again, with the old note cleared from their row.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.095
A suspended member can only be reinstated. The dialog says what that means, before

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:32.451
anything happens.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.232
A toast confirms it, and the list shows them Active.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.228
On the server, sign-in opens again. Sessions that the suspension ended stay ended.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.364
The same rules hold: not your own account, and only an Admin for staff.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.954
That completes journey twenty-seven.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.802
That's slice twenty-seven point two. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for

00:01:18.802 --> 00:01:20.643
health in body and spirit.
